{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（10日）下午5時許，警方接獲報案，指葵涌貨櫃碼頭南路18號和黃物流中心發生意外，一輛鏟車懷疑跌落載貨平台，一名工人被困。他獲救時清醒，救護員用紗布為其包紥頭部，送往瑪嘉烈醫院。案件暫列工業意外有人受傷，警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.685879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:51:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.253692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.253692+00:00","content_hash":"62ef668e4ada473267b32f5a9ed219b6d8b0dfefaabcd4901dd12f192e9a60e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}